# ─── Supabase Configuration ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. Create a project at https://supabase.com
# 2. Copy Project Settings -> API -> Project URL & Project API Keys (anon / public)
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key

# ─── Google OAuth Configuration in Supabase Dashboard ───────────────────────
# In Supabase Dashboard -> Authentication -> Providers -> Google:
# 1. Enable Google provider
# 2. Enter Client ID and Client Secret (from Google Cloud Console -> APIs & Services -> Credentials)
# 3. Add Authorized Redirect URI to your Google Cloud Console OAuth 2.0 Client:
#    https://<your-project-id>.supabase.co/auth/v1/callback
#
# In Supabase Dashboard -> Authentication -> URL Configuration:
# - Site URL:
#     Development: http://localhost:5173
#     Production:  https://your-infodesk-app.vercel.app
# - Redirect URLs:
#     http://localhost:5173/**
#     http://localhost:5173/auth/callback
#     https://your-infodesk-app.vercel.app/**
#     https://your-infodesk-app.vercel.app/auth/callback
